          "quote": "The Al35Cr18Ti42Fe5 and Al40Cr18Ti37Fe5 alloys had dual-phase structures consisted of B2 (CsCl-prototype; cP2; Pm-3m) and C14 Laves (MnZn2-prototype; hP12; P63/mmc) phases (Fig. 1).",
